  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "World 5 frozen difficulties use direct level 50, 72, 81 and 90 values derived from the committed version-4.4 template and hard-level inputs.",
    "Midnight Tumult deals 250% ATK Lightning damage, detonates an existing Kafka Shock, and applies the two-turn 300% ATK Shock with a 120% base chance.",
    "Caressing Moonlight deals 300% ATK to the primary target and 200% to adjacent targets, detonating the primary Shock and spreading Shock only when the primary target was Shocked.",
    "Silent and Sharp Mockery deals 250% ATK Lightning damage to all opponents and Tremble detonates Kafka Shock on attacked Shocked targets.",
    "Spirit Whisper applies Dominated with a 120% base chance and advances the target to a forced Basic ATK against a random ally.",
    "Psychological Suggestion marks up to two opponents and queues Revelation; Revelation applies Dominated, advances marked targets and clears the suggestion.",
    "Seething Whisper of the Fallen deals 300% ATK to the primary target, applies Shock, and deals 250% ATK to every other Shocked opponent.",
    "Cruelty listens for a non-Kafka actor damaging a Shocked target and emits one 100% ATK Lightning follow-up per turn.",
    "Griever adds a permanent two-percent dynamic damage boost when Kafka applies or propagates Shock.",
    "All three phase rotations, Shock detonations, forced control, queued Revelation and passive reactions use shared Rule IR without a native handler."
  ]
